        "paragraphs": [
          "Before I was a designer, I was the girl who joined in on everything creative: competitions, singing, dancing, music and art.",
          "Being creative has been part of my life since I was little.",
          "and I'm still that girl ♡",
          "In class 12, I chose Science. It was a hard time in my life, and I wasn't sure which direction to take.",
          "I looked into fashion design at NIFT, and I also cleared NATA, the architecture entrance exam. In the end, I dropped both and started with Communication Design.",
          "From there I moved to UI/UX, and then to product design.",
          "it wasn't a straight path ✿",
          "Outside of work, I love learning new things, exploring ideas and having deep conversations.",
          "I also find creativity in everyday life.",
          "here's me, as a receipt →",
          "Happy to chat, any time."
        ],
